        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SVYHd2N7ZoONTLxxr3SlWVFogrg\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the percentage of the population in the UK who consumed the recommended daily amount of fruit and vegetables in 2002, 2006 and 2010. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"Uqpqdj1GJoEkqlxj1aYlgWErguh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - UK Fruit &amp; Vegetable Consumption Trends 2002-2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BYDmdTmrLovqhQx0Ps7lf6Hkg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i UK Fruit &amp; Vegetable Consumption Trends 2002-2010 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ phần trăm d&acirc;n số Anh (bao gồm nam giới, nữ giới v&agrave; trẻ em) đ&atilde; ti&ecirc;u thụ lượng tr&aacute;i c&acirc;y v&agrave; rau củ khuyến nghị h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y trong ba năm: 2002, 2006 v&agrave; 2010.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVREdkcdDoiuwixGVrXlEimng9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung: </strong>Paraphrase đề UK Fruit &amp; Vegetable Consumption Trends 2002-2010 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ người đ&aacute;p ứng lượng tr&aacute;i c&acirc;y v&agrave; rau củ khuyến nghị h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y - 3 nh&oacute;m (males, females, children) - địa điểm (UK) - 3 năm (2002, 2006, 2010).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SAQxdgsL6o1FJYx9eUwlYqvBgge\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQn8dU3IToFrThxBuZOlJ4Sdg5c\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Trend</strong>: Tất cả 3 nh&oacute;m đều trải qua sự tăng trưởng ban đầu, đạt đỉnh v&agrave;o năm 2006, sau đ&oacute; giảm v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQn8dU3IToFrThxBuZOlJ4Sdg5c\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Difference</strong>: Phụ nữ li&ecirc;n tục ghi nhận tỷ lệ phần trăm cao nhất trong suốt thời gian, trong khi trẻ em vẫn ở mức thấp nhất trong tất cả c&aacute;c năm được khảo s&aacute;t.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KYM4ddF3Nod0xmxPUhulWaqjg3d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KmJidCEtvoXsooxfg0nlI3RngZd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Adult populations (D&acirc;n số trưởng th&agrave;nh: Women v&agrave; Men)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKdhdanzMoMn9mxzY1klspUcgne\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1)<strong> So s&aacute;nh số liệu của Women v&agrave; Men ở năm đầu ti&ecirc;n 2002</strong> <em>(24.75% women cao hơn một ch&uacute;t so với 22% men)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Women qua c&aacute;c năm, v&igrave; c&oacute; số liệu cao nhất</strong> <em>(từ 24.75% năm 2002 tăng vọt l&ecirc;n 32% năm 2006 - đ&acirc;y l&agrave; peak cao nhất của to&agrave;n bộ biểu đồ, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống 27% năm 2010)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Men qua c&aacute;c năm, so s&aacute;nh với Women v&igrave; c&oacute; similar trajectory</strong> <em>(từ 22% năm 2002 tăng l&ecirc;n 28% năm 2006, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống 24% năm 2010, gần với số liệu ban đầu)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HdJgd2k5roDDvnxYToJlHaRBgCb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rs1QdpGB7oSzzExe0VAlKiasg9e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Children</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5dqd9nO1oWdKUxywl5l0bYggpe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu Children ở năm đầu ti&ecirc;n 2002 v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh với adults</strong> <em>(chỉ 11%, khoảng một nửa so với người lớn)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Children qua c&aacute;c năm</strong> <em>(từ 11% năm 2002 tăng l&ecirc;n 16.5% năm 2006 với mức tăng 5.5 điểm phần trăm, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống 13.5% năm 2010, lu&ocirc;n thấp hơn đ&aacute;ng kể cả 2 nh&oacute;m người lớn trong suốt giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KVX2dj2hXoaQicxXXS6licq4gdf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BMU6dhTL1o1FbTx3FwjlVZU7g6g\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, từ <strong>\"consume/intake\"</strong> sẽ xuất hiện với tần suất cao, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh h&atilde;y c&ugrave;ng nhau học một số c&aacute;ch diễn đạt \"<strong>sự ti&ecirc;u thụ</strong>\" nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">consumed the recommended amount of... | met the recommended daily intake of...</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">consumption levels | intake levels</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HiBjdYruDodZggxuWQhlhVengvd\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sq5TdyINToHWzoxG2iJlBtvog3b\" data-list=\"bullet\">Overall, all three demographic groups experienced an initial increase in <strong>consumption levels</strong>, peaking in 2006, before declining by the end of the period.&nbsp;</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sq5TdyINToHWzoxG2iJlBtvog3b\" data-list=\"bullet\">The bar chart illustrates the proportion of males, females, and children in the UK who <strong>met the recommended daily intake</strong> of fruit and vegetables across three separate years: 2002, 2006, and 2010.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
